Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:10:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Sheet remembers its ability tab; Notebook and sketch
 controls 44px on touch; caret after a mark (#24, #25, #44)

InvestigatorDossier keeps the ability tab per character and view in a module map and makes the tab buttons 44px on coarse pointers. NotebookView and SketchPad drop the md: prefix on their 44px rules and add them where there was none (folder tabs, author filters, Add entry, Send, entry buttons, contents ribbon, sketch tools and inks). prefixLines puts the caret after the mark when nothing was selected. Checked in Chromium at 390 and 820 on both desks: no notebook or sketch control under 44px, the ability tab survives a desk tab switch, Heading, List and Quote on an empty line keep the caret after the mark; vite build passes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
